OL,3,GNEWSAAre countryside buses coming back
OL,4,Ainto business?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil-funded rural buses described as
OL,7,Fa "lifeline" by some are enjoying a
OL,8,Fresurgence after years of decline and
OL,9,Fnew laws are giving authorities more
OL,10,Fpower. Does this mean buses are back in
OL,11,Fbusiness?
OL,13,FGovernment data shows council support
OL,14,Ffor local buses is rising. With the
OL,15,Fexception of London, 17% of bus miles
OL,16,Ftravelled across England were supported
OL,17,Ffinancially by government.
OL,19,FThat's down from almost a quarter in
OL,20,F2010, with bigger drops in rural areas,
OL,21,Fbut it is up from a pre-pandemic low of
OL,22,F13% in 2019-20.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
